- support_email = Settings.email.it_support
- url = Settings.url + '/verify_email' + '?' + {token: @token, destination: @destination}.to_param

%p
  Dear
  = @user.given_name + ','

%p
  We have received a request to update the primary email address on your Croucher account to
  = @new_email + "."
  To complete this change and keep your account secure, we need to confirm that this address belongs to you.

%p
  Please verify your new email address by clicking
  = link_to('here', url, target: '_blank', style: 'text-decoration: none; color: #EE3A43; cursor: pointer;') + '.'
  Once verified, your new email will be used for all future sign-ins and account communications.

%p
  Thank you for helping us keep your account secure.

%p
  Best regards,
  %br
  The Croucher Team
